// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Admiral Sutter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P91372458" "Admiral Sutter"
// ProfessionString :
"P1849805912" "Rear Admiral, United States Navy"
// DescriptionString :
"P2358320101" "Rear Admiral Theodore H. Sutter has served his country with distinction for the last 38 years. Though it has been a decade since he commanded a surface vessel, Admiral Sutter has always prefered to 'lead from the front.' The coming Praetorian Invasion has given Sutter an excuse to once again move into a command position directly on the front lines and has assembled a fleet of warships to protect Paragon City's harbors."
// LocationString :
"P224065995" "Independence Port"
// TaskForceInvite :
"P3833050900" "<color white>{HeroName}, at ease {hero.gender=male son|lass}. What I'm about to tell you is highly classified information. We've detected an energy signature out in the middle of the Atlantic Ocean. Portal Corp has verified our own analysis that the energy signature is indeed a dimensional portal and it is Praetorian. Surveillance satellites and atmospheric craft have been incapable of getting a positive identification of the target site, but we do know that it is moving. I've been assigned by the Joint Chiefs to investigate this rift signature with a detatchment from the 11th Fleet. My orders, as they currently stand, are to investigate and idenitfy the rift and eliminate it <i>if</i> possible.<br><br>I've served this country with distinction and valor for almost 40 years, {HeroName}, and I don't plan on retiring with a stain on my courage. I don't like to lose and sure as hell have no intentions of tucking tail and running in the face of adversity. If the Praetorians have come here looking for a fight, then on my grand daddy's grave I swear to give them one they'll not soon forget.<br><br>That's where you come in. Fleet command has a tight grip on the budget and have only authorized me a small number of surface vessels and personnel for this operation, but they didn't say anything about me recruiting outside help from heroes such as yourselves. As soon as you've assembled your team, we'll be under way.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P564567705" "I don't mean no disrespect, {HeroName}, you're a shinning example of patriotism and courage in the face of adversity, but this task is just too dangerous for me to ask you to volunteer for.<br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 20. If they are over Level 40, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 40 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P2090312107" "Much obliged, {HeroName}, but I've read your dossier and believe me when I say that your capabilities far exceed the task at hand. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 20. If they are over Level 40, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 40 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P187820509" "To form a task force, you need four or more heroes in your group. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 20. If they are over Level 40, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 40 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P1410880979" "I need to speak to your team leader."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P3314444780" "I need everyone in your team present and accounted for."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P3841523675" "Some members of your team don't meet the requirements for this task. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 20. If they are over Level 40, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 40 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// TaskForceName :
"P2835780880" "Task Force Neptune"
// TaskForceName :
"P2368399656" "Task Force Poseidon"
// TaskForceName :
"P2089936040" "Task Force Nautilus"
// TaskForceName :
"P2717756141" "Task Force Trident"
// TaskForceName :
"P2222060528" "Task Force Shellback"
// TaskForceName :
"P3359473789" "Task Force Pollywog"
// TaskForceName :
"P190320169" "Task Force Orca"
// TaskForceName :
"P801905134" "Task Force Narwhal"
// TaskForceName :
"P1490985172" "Task Force Kraken"
// TaskForceName :
"P1783595898" "Task Force Broadside"
// TaskForceName :
"P1989411510" "Task Force Oceanus"
// TaskForceName :
"P2273247172" "Task Force Tethys"
// TaskForceName :
"P1061439155" "Task Force Nimitz"
// TaskForceName :
"P3462671936" "Task Force Essex"
// TaskForceName :
"P3388832879" "Task Force Enterprise"
// HelloString :
"P1897578660" "At ease, {TaskForceName}. I may be a career man, but leave the formal salutes and order barking between me and my crew. What do you have to report?"
// HelloString :
"P900821963" "I sat behind a desk during the first Rikti War, I'm not about to do the same with these Praetorians."
// HelloString :
"P3434596164" "Back in my day you could get a decent cup of coffee on a ship, I made sure of that. But now, all that these kids know is mocha-frappa-crappa-this and iced-hazel-nonsense-that. Get me a hot cup of black coffee and I'll sail this fleet right into the heart of Praetoria!"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P167986732" "I'm afraid my current orders are classified."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1194604107" "{HeroName}, my {hero.gender=male daughter|son} is a huge fan."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1789083748" "Superb work, {HeroName}. The Praetorians appear to be probing our defenses with lightning raids, but the only information they'll be getting back is that we gave them a whoopin'."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3102816718" "Word from the C.S.S. is that you've got your hands full, {HeroName}. This operation is strictly voluntary, so I'm going to have to ask you to complete your obligations before I can authorize your assistance in the matter at hand."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P928549453" "My contacts in S.A.M. tell me that you're not ready for an operation of this caliber. Talk to me when you've reached security level 20."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2100509828" "Damn fine work, {HeroName}. Why, if I had a thousand sailors like you the rest of the Navy could retire!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1000899654" "You're a real trooper, {HeroName}, I can see why my {hero.gender=male daughter|son} looks up to you."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2472804946" "How is it that you can see my FailsafeLevelString?  That should be impossible, unless we've raised the level cap or you're peeking through .pigg files."
// IntroString :
"P856364347" ""
